Package: callismart-devmgr
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Callistus Nwachukwu <admin@callismart.com.ng>
Depends: bash, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, apache2, openssl, pkexec | policykit-1
Recommends: mkcert, libnss3-tools
Homepage: https://github.com/callismartLtd/callismart-devmgr
Description: Desktop manager for local Apache sites, PHP versions and SSL
 Callismart Dev Manager is a GTK app on top of three command-line tools:
 sitemgr (Apache vhosts, document roots, per-site PHP through mod_php or
 PHP-FPM, HTTPS and /etc/hosts entries), phpmgr (PHP versions, FPM services
 and extensions) and localssl (local certificates via mkcert).
